  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Débloque la chambre du motel de Beladonis sur la Route 8.",
      "short_effect": "Débloque la chambre du motel de Beladonis sur la Route 8.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Unlocks Looker’s motel room on Route 8.",
      "short_effect": "Unlocks Looker’s motel room on Route 8.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "「アーカラじま　８ばんどうろの\nモーテル　きゃくしつ　にて　まつ」と\nかかれた　なぞの　カード。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "“아칼라섬 8번도로의\n모텔 객실에서 기다리겠다”라고\n적혀 있는 의문의 카드.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "上面寫有「在阿卡拉島８號道路的\n汽車旅館客房裡等」的\n謎之卡片。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une carte étrange sur laquelle quelqu’un a écrit :\n« Je t’attends dans une chambre du motel de la\nRoute 8 sur l’île d’Akala. »",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine rätselhafte Karte, auf der Folgendes steht:\n„Ich warte im Motel am Rand von Route 8 auf\nAkala.“",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Misteriosa nota que reza: “Te espero en una\nhabitación del motel de la Ruta 8 en Akala”.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Biglietto misterioso. C’è scritto:\n“Ti aspetto in una stanza del motel di Akala,\nlungo il Percorso 8”.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mysterious card.\nWritten on it is a request for you to go to a\nguest room in an Akala motel on Route 8.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "「アーカラ島　８番道路の\nモーテル　客室　にて　待つ」と\n書かれた　謎の　カード。",
